    "sections": {
        "description": "Underlay is a plain, lightweight block theme built to work seamlessly with the Blocksify block plugin. It gives your site a clean, standards-following foundation: a header and a footer you edit in the Site Editor, posts and pages, comments, pagination and a \"Blank page\" template for pages designed with blocks. It has no colours and no fonts of its own, and then stays out of the way. Accessible, right-to-left ready, WooCommerce supported."
    },
